		{
			dependencies: ["0EB3A2F442EEA337"]
			description: [
				"Like many ores, multiple processing steps improves yield. Try going from Raw to Crushed to Dirty Dust and then choose what's more important, a better yield or secondary resources. Mill crushed Bismuth into Dirty Bismuth Dust, with a chance for an extra dust."
				""
				"Washing can recover secondary resources such as &6Silver or Nether Quartz&r. Clean dust can then enter the melting chain; inspect the recipe before routing your fluids."
